I have successfully fixed the compilation error in  MainActivity.kt.
Cause of the Issue
The method workspace.currentIdentity() returns a nullable String?. Calling .isBlank() directly on a nullable receiver or passing it where a non-null String was expected resulted in Kotlin type mismatch and safety errors (Only safe (?.) or non-null asserted (!!.) calls are allowed on a nullable receiver of type 'kotlin.String?').
Fix Applied
1.
Updated  MainActivity.kt to use safe unwrapping (workspace.currentIdentity() ?: error(...)) when resolving the workspace identity.
2.
Updated  MainActivity.kt to provide a fallback empty string (workspace.currentIdentity() ?: "") for the currentWorkspaceIdentity lambda.





